            {
                "entry_id": "d1ce2967-5309-3dec-a640-eba1a4ba0d97",
                "word": "chested",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1115cfc1-1b2e-3ff7-92e1-488c9ae655a8",
                        "entry_id": "d1ce2967-5309-3dec-a640-eba1a4ba0d97",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having a chest (with a specified quality)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "in-compounds",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a5c65c3-3702-49e5-aa25-3422497bb805",
                                "sense_id": "1115cfc1-1b2e-3ff7-92e1-488c9ae655a8",
                                "text": "Jenny was the most flat-chested of her friends."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ad09a8e-598f-4e4a-b411-66bd7ffe21dc",
                                "sense_id": "1115cfc1-1b2e-3ff7-92e1-488c9ae655a8",
                                "text": "Spare, like Henry the Fifth, almost to the manly defect of leanness, his proportions were slight to those which gave such portly majesty to the vast-chested Edward, but they evinced the promise of almost equal strength […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ec48062-0153-45ff-bebd-d8ceebdb99f0",
                                "sense_id": "1115cfc1-1b2e-3ff7-92e1-488c9ae655a8",
                                "text": "Beholding Ajax then, the aged king / Asked yet again: \"Who is that other chief / Of the Achaians, tall, and large of limb,— / Taller and broader-chested than the rest?\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "665d676f-29c4-40d4-bfaa-0fdcc8dad94e",
                                "sense_id": "1115cfc1-1b2e-3ff7-92e1-488c9ae655a8",
                                "text": "Loud greetings followed, and another burst of laughter, heavy, deep-chested and glad."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "52fa4df6-ac65-40be-acdd-a81e90214589",
                                "sense_id": "1115cfc1-1b2e-3ff7-92e1-488c9ae655a8",
                                "text": "From behind him there emerged a broad-chested guard with a long black truncheon in his hand."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4073c537-e1fc-4ec9-8418-4a95fee73e42",
                                "sense_id": "1115cfc1-1b2e-3ff7-92e1-488c9ae655a8",
                                "text": "The schoolmaster himself was very thin, black and pigeon-chested under a woollen pullover."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fcd436d0-466d-4eae-91fc-009f7e4aa369",
                                "sense_id": "1115cfc1-1b2e-3ff7-92e1-488c9ae655a8",
                                "text": "There was a corner shop at the end of my street which stocked these movies that were released in hundreds every week. Each featured the same yellow-skinned, abundantly chested actresses and the same dreadlocked men, and each had a Part 1, a Part 2, and Part 3 - at least. Too bad that the JAMB exam did not test knowledge of Nollywood."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9140aa7f-b594-4017-8b9f-87f847c56ffe",
                                "sense_id": "1115cfc1-1b2e-3ff7-92e1-488c9ae655a8",
                                "text": "The Russian state invests much time and effort in projecting a certain image of Putin to its citizens. We've all seen those ridiculous photographs of King Vladimir, the bare-chested tough hero who wrestles with animals, dives in submarines, and practices judo."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
